[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_air_facility_factor_desc]
Modifica a velocidade de construção de instalações aéreas.

[l_english.air_facility]
Aerodynamics and Avionics Facility

[l_english.air_facility_desc]
Experimental Facilities for Aerodynamics and Avionics allow you to start research projects for aircraft, rockets and related electronics.

[l_english.air_facility_plural]
